<p>Nice SCP although I do feel it needs some work before it gets my upvote.<br />
To be totally honest with you I find the idea of the the pool itself to be far the creepiest thing about this. I don't know if anyone has had the pleasure/misfortune of being in a public baths with most of the lights turned off, but it's pretty much one of the freakiest places I've ever been and I wasn't even in the water.<br />
Right now, I'm imagining something like a dark and dingy public baths in a long disused corner of Site 17. I assume the shark is more or less just a metaphor anyway. It's always what you can't see that scares you the most and I sure as shit would make certain that the lights were kept ON if I was in there&#8230;</p>

